                  "name": "Praia de Patos",
                  "text": "Located in the Galician coastal town of Baiona, Praia de Patos effortlessly captivates ocean lovers. Its dynamic, nature-connected atmosphere makes the beach especially popular with younger crowds and active visitors. People flock here to enjoy long walks along the shore, followed by vigorous swims or simply soaking up the sun on the soft sand. Because Atlantic breezes are common, bringing a light windbreak is often a smart idea.",
